- Confirms file was written to disk (not just network traffic)
- Matches files starting with "invoice.one"

**Expected Results**:
- File: invoice.one:Zone.Identifier
- Location: C:\Users\Bob\Downloads\
- Timestamp: March 26, 2023 @ 22:05:47 UTC
